  "stem": "A body is moving up an inclined plane of angle $\\theta$ with an initial kinetic energy of E. The coefficient of friction between the plane and the body is μ. The work done against friction before the body comes to a stop is?",
  "options": {
    "A": "$\\frac{\\mu \\sin \\theta E}{\\mu \\cos \\theta + \\sin \\theta}$",
    "B": "$\\frac{\\cos \\theta E}{\\mu \\cos \\theta + \\sin \\theta}$",
    "C": "$\\frac{\\mu \\cos \\theta E}{\\cos \\theta + \\mu \\sin \\theta}$",
    "D": "$\\ \\frac{\\mu \\cos \\theta E}{\\mu \\cos \\theta + \\sin \\theta}$"
  },
  "answer": {
    "keys": [
      "D"
    ]
